+# Options
+
+This rule supports the following shared configuration options:
+
+* The ESLint `settings` entry `mocha/additionalTestFunctions` accepts an array of function-name strings to protect. This might be used with a custom Mocha extension, such as [`ember-mocha`](https://github.com/switchfly/ember-mocha).
+
+```json
+{
+    "rules": {
+        "mocha/no-exclusive-tests": "error"
+    },
+    "settings": {
+       "mocha/additionalTestFunctions": [
+           "describeModule"
+       ]
+    }
+}
+```
+
 ## When Not To Use It
 
 * If you really want to execute only one test-suite or test-case because all other tests should not be executed, turn this rule off.
